+///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
+/// OpenGL Mathematics (glm.g-truc.net)
+///
+/// Copyright (c) 2005 - 2014 G-Truc Creation (www.g-truc.net)
+/// Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
