+    ${Endif}
+
+    # Run the ConfigureRT.exe program to copy the most recent version of
+    # vulkan-<abimajor>-*.dll to vulkan-<abimajor>.dll, and to set up layer registry
+    # entries to use layers from the corresponding SDK
